OL,4,C'My leukaemia was caused by years of   
OL,5,Cunnecessary chemotherapy'              
OL,6,GA man who developed leukaemia after    
OL,7,Gtaking chemotherapy tablets for a      
OL,8,Gbrain tumour for almost 13 years says  
OL,9,Ghe feels betrayed by those responsible 
OL,10,Gfor his care.                          
OL,12,FMark Callaghan was prescribed          
OL,13,Ftemozolomide at University Hospitals   
OL,14,FCoventry and Warwickshire (UHCW) for   
OL,15,Fmore than 12 years longer than NHS     
OL,16,Fguidance typically recommends.         
OL,18,FHe said neither consultant Prof Ian    
OL,19,FBrown nor clinical nurse specialist    
OL,20,FIan Edwards warned him that leukaemia  
OL,21,Fwas a potential side effect of the     
OL,22,Ftreatment.                        G2/4 
