OL,4,CPolice investigate racist remarks      
OL,5,Cafter crash                            
OL,6,GPolice are investigating reports of    
OL,7,Gracist comments made after a crash in  
OL,8,GStoke-on-Trent, while stressing there  
OL,9,Gis no evidence a vehicle was           
OL,10,Gdeliberately driven at children        
OL,11,Gleaving a nearby mosque.               
OL,13,FThe crash involved a Vauxhall Insignia 
OL,14,Fand a grey Hyundai Ioniq taxi in the   
OL,15,Fcar park of the Aldi supermarket on    
OL,16,FTrentham Road, Longton, on Friday.     
OL,18,FStaffordshire Police said the driver   
OL,19,Fof the Vauxhall allegedly directed     
OL,20,Fracist comments towards the occupants  
OL,21,Fof the taxi before leaving the scene.  
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
